<li nodeId="d2592053b9ff47589a6c06ac9e9da8be"><span font-size="14">因为if...else组件为判断组件，会有两个结果，因此连在后面的会有两个组件</span></li>
<li nodeId="092ba001ae954cc9b56414b8712effaa"><span font-size="14">假设按照此画布逻辑，不满足测试条件的会旁路输出，满足条件的会与kafka数据源2的处理结果汇总之后再进行处理</span></li>
<li nodeId="4be75c9b673848c6b336c94e392843d6"><span font-size="14">从左侧拖一个旁路输出组件至于if...else组件左下方，</span></li>
<li nodeId="b76997c890e34c53951514ea682ed15a"><span font-size="14">用左边的连线将if...else组件和旁路输出组件连起来</span></li>
<li nodeId="0eceb589ff2749dbbe02ce4937482666"><span font-size="14">点击左边的连线，可以选择逻辑是true还是false的进入旁路输出</span></li>
<li nodeId="103429d465294c33ab7fc8e987428fe8"><span font-size="14">根据</span><a href="https://km.sankuai.com/page/1200679482" title="https://km.sankuai.com/page/1200679482" autoUpdate="true" nodeId="dafb88b5ac324c7787f723f8493608d2"><span font-size="14">https://km.sankuai.com/page/1200679482</span></a><span font-size="14">、</span><a href="https://km.sankuai.com/page/1200659710" title="https://km.sankuai.com/page/1200659710" autoUpdate="true" nodeId="5354eac0c41741b688418081a16df6f0"><span font-size="14">https://km.sankuai.com/page/1200659710</span></a><span font-size="14">按需配置</span></li>
